    <string name="safety_title">Train safely</string>
    <string name="safety_body">Warm up before loading skills. Perform the prescribed variation only with clean control; otherwise use its displayed regression. If no lower rung is listed, reduce range, repetitions or sets, or add support and assistance. Leave repetitions in reserve and do not force German-hang or shoulder range. Stop for sharp pain, numbness, dizziness, or loss of control. Persistent symptoms need qualified medical advice.</string>
    <string name="about_title">About Street Gymnastics</string>
    <string name="about_body">We made Street Gymnastics from our own training. We wanted an app without AI, with no direction to choose and no complicated setup: it works like going to a class. Every day’s class is ready for you. Move ahead faster when it feels easy, or repeat a class until it does, one step at a time towards the skills that made you want to start.</string>
